[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3562142830","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/113009#issuecomment-3562142830","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113009","id":3562142830,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7UUfxu","user":{"login":"Ivorforce","id":2308167,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMDgxNjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2308167?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce","html_url":"https://github.com/Ivorforce","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-11-21T09:26:56Z","updated_at":"2025-11-21T09:26:56Z","body":"It should be possible to fix the code and allow disabling `Mutex`. I think the reason it's failing is that the bound `Mutex` is located in the `CoreBind` namespace, so the forward-declaration of `Mutex` is incorrect.\r\ncc @Repiteo ","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3562142830/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3568740116","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/113009#issuecomment-3568740116","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113009","id":3568740116,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7UtqcU","user":{"login":"LanzaSchneider","id":24624901,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI0NjI0OTAx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/24624901?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/LanzaSchneider","html_url":"https://github.com/LanzaSchneider","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LanzaSchneider/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LanzaSchneider/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LanzaSchneider/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LanzaSchneider/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LanzaSchneider/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LanzaSchneider/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LanzaSchneider/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LanzaSchneider/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LanzaSchneider/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-11-24T02:39:24Z","updated_at":"2025-11-24T02:39:24Z","body":"@Ivorforce \r\nI completely agree that fixing the forward-declaration would be the ideal solution. However, after investigating, I found a technical limitation:\r\nThe problematic forward-declaration is located in generated code (core/disabled_classes.gen.h), which is produced during the build process. For a proper fix, the code generator would need to know whether a class belongs to the CoreBind namespace, but currently there's no unified registration mechanism for this metadata.\r\nWithout a way to detect the CoreBind namespace during code generation, we'd need to either:\r\n\r\n* Implement a new registration system for namespace metadata (a larger architectural change)\r\n* Manually maintain special cases in the generator (fragile)\r\n\r\nGiven these constraints, adding Mutex to hardcoded_classes seemed like the most pragmatic solution to prevent the build profile system from creating invalid configurations. It ensures users won't encounter cryptic compilation errors when using \"detect from project\" functionality.\r\nThat said, I'm open to implementing a more comprehensive fix if there's a clean way to expose namespace information to the code generator. Would you have suggestions on the best approach for that?","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3568740116/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3569347114","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/113009#issuecomment-3569347114","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113009","id":3569347114,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7Uv-oq","user":{"login":"Ivorforce","id":2308167,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMDgxNjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2308167?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce","html_url":"https://github.com/Ivorforce","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-11-24T07:45:30Z","updated_at":"2026-05-07T22:55:05Z","body":"We had an earlier version of the code generator that did not fail with different namespaces, i believe. We simply didn't think of this limitation when starting to use templates. It should be possible to solve this problem by using something more similar to the old solution again, without informing the code generator of namespaces.\r\n\r\nEdit: I now know it was always failing, just not as loudly. See https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119048","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3569347114/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5070033065","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/113009#issuecomment-5070033065","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113009","id":5070033065,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABLjKQqQ","user":{"login":"LanzaSchneider","id":24624901,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI0NjI0OTAx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/24624901?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/LanzaSchneider","html_url":"https://github.com/LanzaSchneider","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LanzaSchneider/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LanzaSchneider/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LanzaSchneider/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LanzaSchneider/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LanzaSchneider/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LanzaSchneider/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LanzaSchneider/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LanzaSchneider/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LanzaSchneider/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-07-24T12:51:35Z","updated_at":"2026-07-24T12:51:35Z","body":"Covered by #115410 ","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5070033065/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]